  "about": "App cues for recordings without a macOS menu bar (slice m3-05c-import-signals). Read only lines in the window chrome band (the top max(min_px, fraction x frame height) of a frame). 1. Host: the first URL-bar host in reading order (2+ labels of [a-z0-9] with inner '-', last label letters only and not in not_tlds, no '@' in the token; scheme, path, query and fragment cut off; kept only when the masker leaves it unchanged). The app is the entry whose host pattern ('host' or 'host/path-prefix'; matches the host or any subdomain; the path prefix is for matching only) is the longest match, else browser. 2. Else a title, as a whole word (case-insensitive) on a chrome line: topmost line, then leftmost, then the longest title, then table order; no host. 3. Else no cue. Names and bundle ids come only from this table. The Swift copy is apps/mac/Sources/OffloadImport/AppCues.swift; a test keeps them equal.",
